codex
I found the exact platform cause: this audit shell’s process namespace does not align with `/proc`, so Lean cannot resolve its own executable (`IO.appPath`), which in turn prevents Lake from detecting its installation. I’m testing the supported environment override and PTY execution paths before treating this as an infrastructure limitation; no provenance input is implicated.
